{"title":"The US Leads the World in Robots (Once You Count Correctly)","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/939735917/0/marginalrevolution~The-US-Leads-the-World-in-Robots-Once-You-Count-Correctly.html","date":1767701869000,"content":"<p>If you search for data on robots you will quickly find data from the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://ifr.org/wr-industrial-robots/\">International Federation of Robotics</a> which places South Korea in the lead with ~818 robots per 10,000 manufacturing workers, followed by China, Japan, Germany and finally at 10th place the US at ~304 robots per 10,000. The IFR, however, misses the most sophisticated, impressive and versatile robots, namely Teslas with FSD capability. Teslas see the world, navigate complex environments, move tons of metal at high speeds and must perform at very high levels of tolerance and safety. If you included Teslas as robots, as you should, the US leaps to the top.</p>\r\n<p>Moreover, once you understand Teslas as robots, Optimus, Tesla’s humanoid robot division, stops being a quixotic Elon side-project and becomes the obvious continuation of Tesla’s core work.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/robot_density_chart-1024x597.png\" width=\"1024\" height=\"597\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/robot_density_chart-1024x597.png 1024w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/robot_density_chart-300x175.png 300w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/robot_density_chart-768x448.png 768w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/robot_density_chart-1536x896.png 1536w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/robot_density_chart.png 1782w\" /></p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/the-us-leads-the-world-in-robots-once-you-count-correctly.html\">The US Leads the World in Robots (Once You Count Correctly)</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/939735917/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/939735917/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/939735917/marginalrevolution,https%3a%2f%2fmarginalrevolution.com%2fwp-content%2fuploads%2f2025%2f12%2frobot_density_chart-1024x597.png\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/939735917/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/939735917/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/939735917/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/the-us-leads-the-world-in-robots-once-you-count-correctly.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/the-us-leads-the-world-in-robots-once-you-count-correctly.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/the-us-leads-the-world-in-robots-once-you-count-correctly.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/the-us-leads-the-world-in-robots-once-you-count-correctly.html#comment-161002425\">In reply to Gilligan.  